<h1 id="qimpltdd-title" style="color:#0d47a1;font-size:1.5em;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #90caf9;padding-bottom:0.25em;margin-top:0"><code>qimpltdd</code> — quick implement (TDD chain)</h1>

Use when the user includes **`qimpltdd`**. Same four-step orchestration as **`qimpl`**, but **chain 2** rules replace every chain 1 reference.

---

<h2 id="qimpltdd-outline" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">Document outline</h2>

