<h2 id="qimpltdd-trigger" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">1. Trigger</h2>

| User says | Agent does |
|-----------|------------|
| **`qimpltdd`** + task or plan path | Execute **qimpl** steps 1–4 with [substitution table](#qimpltdd-substitute) applied at every delegate. |

**Do not** use plain **`qimpl`**, **`onlyref`**, **`aciub`**, or **`implref`** mid-run on the same refactor.

---

<h2 id="qimpltdd-delegate" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">2. Classic delegate (required)</h2>

**Read and execute** the full procedure in:

**`.cursor/rules/qimpl-quick-implement-refactor-plan.mdc`** (**`qimpl`**)

Steps: ambiguity gate → plan → implement all phases → layman closing table.

**Whenever `qimpl` names a chain 1 rule path or keyword**, use the matching **chain 2 row** in [§3](#qimpltdd-substitute) instead. **`qimpl` does not auto-resolve TDD paths** — this file’s table is authoritative.

**Override when `qimpltdd` is the top-level trigger (not bare `onlyreftdd`):**

| Sub-rule says | Under **`qimpltdd`** |
|---------------|----------------------|
| **`onlyreftdd`** §1 — “Do not implement code” | **Ignore for step 3** — plan shape only; **`qimpl` step 3 runs in the same session** |
| **`onlyreftdd`** closing — “implement with `aciubtdd`” handoff | **Do not stop there** — immediately run **`aciubtdd <plan.md>`** per **`qimpl` step 3** |
| User also asks for a layman summary table | Step 4 **after** step 3 (or on stop), not instead of step 3 |

Bare **`onlyreftdd`** alone = plan-only handoff. **`qimpltdd`** = full **`qimpl`** orchestration with chain 2 substitution — **never plan-only exit**.

---

<h2 id="qimpltdd-substitute" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">3. Chain substitution table (required)</h2>

| `qimpl` step | Chain 1 (ignore when **qimpltdd**) | Chain 2 (use instead) |
|--------------|--------------------------------------|------------------------|
| Step 2 — plan | **`onlyref`** · `.cursor/rules/onlyref-refactor-plan-author-only.mdc` | **`onlyreftdd`** · `.cursor/rules/tdd/onlyreftdd-refactor-plan-author-only.mdc` |
| Step 3 — implement loop | **`aciub`** · `.cursor/rules/aciub-allow-continue-iterations-until-blocked.mdc` | **`aciubtdd`** · `.cursor/rules/tdd/aciubtdd-allow-continue-iterations-until-blocked.mdc` |
| Step 3 — impl spine | **`implref`** / **`resumimpl`** · `.cursor/rules/implref-resumimpl-refactor-plan-followthrough.mdc` | **`implreftdd`** / **`resumimpltdd`** · `.cursor/rules/tdd/implreftdd-resumimpl-refactor-plan-followthrough.mdc` |

**Invocation examples:**

```text
qimpltdd CR_Task2 remove E2B clitics end-to-end
qimpltdd cursor_gen/refactor_plans/new/REFACTOR_CLITICS_SCS_FLAT_SCOPES.md
aciubtdd cursor_gen/refactor_plans/wip/REFACTOR_REMOVE_E2B_CLITICS.md
```

After step 2, run **`aciubtdd <plan.md>`** (not **`aciub`**) for each plan path — **in the same session**, without asking permission (same bar as **`qimpl` step 2 → step 3**).

---

<h2 id="qimpltdd-delta" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">4. TDD delta</h2>

In addition to **qimpl** plan requirements:

- Step 2 plans must include per-phase **TDD mode** (`strict-TDD` / `smoke-after-delete`) per **onlyreftdd**.
- Step 3 loop order: **`test → code → test → fix`** (or smoke-after-delete) per **aciubtdd** / **implreftdd**.
- Closing table **Tests** row should note TDD modes used.

---

<h2 id="qimpltdd-drift" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">5. Anti-drift</h2>

> **Mirror qimpl except chain substitution + TDD delta.** Orchestration steps, ambiguity gate, layman summary shape, and stop conditions = **`qimpl`**. Edit **`qimpl`** once for shared workflow changes; edit **this file** only when TDD chain paths or TDD emphasis change.

---

<h2 id="qimpltdd-self" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">6. Self-check (agent)</h2>

- [ ] User invoked **`qimpltdd`**.
- [ ] Full **qimpl** procedure executed with **§3 substitution table** applied at every delegate.
- [ ] **Step 3 ran** — not plan-only handoff (unless true blocker in step 1 or step 3).
- [ ] No chain 1 keywords used for plan/implement on this refactor.
- [ ] Layman closing table delivered (step 4 — after step 3 or on stop).
